241
00:24:33,261 --> 00:24:38,291
君と Let's Enjoy! 語り合おうよ 君と Let's Enjoy! 宝物はひとつ
You & Let's Enjoy! Let's talk together! You & Let's Enjoy! Our treasure is one

242
